      }
    }
  },
  {
    "eventSeq": 2,
    "event": {
      "type": "line_added",
      "line": {
        "id": "kd7a20rloq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "roomId": "jd7c4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h2ab",
        "speakerId": "k57a2035sq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "speakerName": "Alex",
        "text": "Okay, I have to tell you about Kevin, my old roommate.",
        "seq": 1,
        "at": 1790000001500
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "eventSeq": 3,
    "event": {
      "type": "member_joined",
      "member": {
        "id": "k57a2099rq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "roomId": "jd7c4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h2ab",
        "name": "Sam",
        "joinedAtSeq": 1,
        "joinedAt": 1790000002500
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "eventSeq": 4,
    "event": {
      "type": "line_added",
      "line": {
        "id": "kd7a20xpnq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "roomId": "jd7c4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h2ab",
        "speakerId": "k57a2099rq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "speakerName": "Sam",
        "text": "The guy with the cat?",
        "seq": 2,
        "at": 1790000005000
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "eventSeq": 5,
    "event": {
      "type": "line_added",
      "line": {
        "id": "kd7a213tmq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "roomId": "jd7c4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h2ab",
        "speakerId": "k57a2035sq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "speakerName": "Alex",
        "text": "No, that's Kevin from work. Roommate Kevin. So for my birthday I bought this huge chocolate cake.",
        "seq": 3,
        "at": 1790000007500
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "eventSeq": 6,
    "event": {
      "type": "line_added",
      "line": {
        "id": "kd7a219xlq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "roomId": "jd7c4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h2ab",
        "speakerId": "k57a2035sq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "speakerName": "Alex",
        "text": "I go to grab it before the party and the box is empty. He ate the whole thing.",
        "seq": 4,
        "at": 1790000011000
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "eventSeq": 7,
    "event": {
      "type": "line_added",
      "line": {
        "id": "kd7a21g1kq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "roomId": "jd7c4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h2ab",
        "speakerId": "k57a2099rq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "speakerName": "Sam",
        "text": "NO WAY he ate the entire cake.",
        "seq": 5,
        "at": 1790000013500
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "eventSeq": 8,
    "event": {
      "type": "member_joined",
      "member": {
        "id": "k57a20fdqq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "roomId": "jd7c4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h2ab",
        "name": "Jamie",
        "joinedAtSeq": 5,
        "joinedAt": 1790000014500
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "eventSeq": 9,
    "event": {
      "type": "line_added",
      "line": {
        "id": "kd7a21m5jq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "roomId": "jd7c4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h2ab",
        "speakerId": "k57a20fdqq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "speakerName": "Jamie",
        "text": "Honestly that's kind of impressive.",
        "seq": 6,
        "at": 1790000016500
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "eventSeq": 10,
    "event": {
      "type": "line_added",
      "line": {
        "id": "kd7a21s9iq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "roomId": "jd7c4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h2ab",
        "speakerId": "k57a2035sq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "speakerName": "Alex",
        "text": "And his excuse was that he thought it was shared fridge food.",
        "seq": 7,
        "at": 1790000019500
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "eventSeq": 11,
    "event": {
      "type": "line_added",
      "line": {
        "id": "kd7a21ydhq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "roomId": "jd7c4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h2ab",
        "speakerId": "k57a2035sq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "speakerName": "Alex",
        "text": "Then last spring he's flying to Seattle for his sister's wedding.",
        "seq": 8,
        "at": 1790000023000
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "eventSeq": 12,
    "event": {
      "type": "line_added",
      "line": {
        "id": "kd7a224hgq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "roomId": "jd7c4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h2ab",
        "speakerId": "k57a2035sq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "speakerName": "Alex",
        "text": "He goes to the Oakland airport. His flight was out of SFO.",
        "seq": 9,
        "at": 1790000026000
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "eventSeq": 13,
    "event": {
      "type": "line_added",
      "line": {
        "id": "kd7a22alfq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "roomId": "jd7c4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h2ab",
        "speakerId": "k57a20fdqq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "speakerName": "Jamie",
        "text": "How do you even do that?",
        "seq": 10,
        "at": 1790000028000
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "eventSeq": 14,
    "event": {
      "type": "line_added",
      "line": {
        "id": "kd7a22gpeq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "roomId": "jd7c4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h2ab",
        "speakerId": "k57a2099rq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "speakerName": "Sam",
        "text": "Did he make it?",
        "seq": 11,
        "at": 1790000030000
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "eventSeq": 15,
    "event": {
      "type": "line_added",
      "line": {
        "id": "kd7a22mtdq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "roomId": "jd7c4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h2ab",
        "speakerId": "k57a2035sq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "speakerName": "Alex",
        "text": "He made the reception. Missed the whole ceremony.",
        "seq": 12,
        "at": 1790000032500
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "eventSeq": 16,
    "event": {
      "type": "line_added",
      "line": {
        "id": "kd7a22sxcq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "roomId": "jd7c4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h2ab",
        "speakerId": "k57a2035sq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "speakerName": "Alex",
        "text": "Oh, and he once got into a full shouting match with our landlord over a parking spot.",
        "seq": 13,
        "at": 1790000036000
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "eventSeq": 17,
    "event": {
      "type": "line_added",
      "line": {
        "id": "kd7a22z1bq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "roomId": "jd7c4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h2ab",
        "speakerId": "k57a20fdqq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "speakerName": "Jamie",
        "text": "Over a parking spot?",
        "seq": 14,
        "at": 1790000038000
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "eventSeq": 18,
    "event": {
      "type": "line_added",
      "line": {
        "id": "kd7a2355aq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "roomId": "jd7c4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h2ab",
        "speakerId": "k57a2035sq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "speakerName": "Alex",
        "text": "He doesn't even own a car.",
        "seq": 15,
        "at": 1790000040000
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "eventSeq": 19,
    "event": {
      "type": "line_added",
      "line": {
        "id": "kd7a23b99q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "roomId": "jd7c4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h2ab",
        "speakerId": "k57a2099rq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "speakerName": "Sam",
        "text": "That is the most Kevin thing I've heard, and I only know him from this call.",
        "seq": 16,
        "at": 1790000043000
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "eventSeq": 20,
    "event": {
      "type": "line_added",
      "line": {
        "id": "kd7a23hd8q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "roomId": "jd7c4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h2ab",
        "speakerId": "k57a2035sq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "speakerName": "Alex",
        "text": "Anyway, he just texted asking if he can come to the reunion.",
        "seq": 17,
        "at": 1790000049000
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "eventSeq": 21,
    "event": {
      "type": "line_added",
      "line": {
        "id": "kd7a23nh7q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "roomId": "jd7c4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h2ab",
        "speakerId": "k57a20fdqq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "speakerName": "Jamie",
        "text": "I'd invite him. He sounds fun.",
        "seq": 18,
        "at": 1790000051500
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "eventSeq": 22,
    "event": {
      "type": "line_added",
      "line": {
        "id": "kd7a23tl6q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "roomId": "jd7c4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h2ab",
        "speakerId": "k57a2099rq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "speakerName": "Sam",
        "text": "After the cake thing? He's lucky anyone still talks to him.",
        "seq": 19,
        "at": 1790000054000
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "eventSeq": 23,
    "event": {
      "type": "line_added",
      "line": {
        "id": "kd7a23zp5q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "roomId": "jd7c4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h2ab",
        "speakerId": "k57a2035sq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "speakerName": "Alex",
        "text": "Also he'd definitely show up at the wrong restaurant.",
        "seq": 20,
        "at": 1790000057000
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "eventSeq": 24,
    "event": {
      "type": "line_added",
      "line": {
        "id": "kd7a245t4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "roomId": "jd7c4q9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h2ab",
        "speakerId": "k57a20lhpq9m2x8vn5k1p3h6t0w4zs70h",
        "speakerName": "Taylor",
        "text": "Wait, the whole cake?",
        "seq": 21,
        "at": 1790000060000
      }
    }
  },
